        rdfs:label "Beroz et al. (2018) Nature Physics & Hartmann et al. (2019) Nature Physics 3D rod-cell nematic verticalization and fountain flow in growing Vibrio cholerae biofilms — Morphological realism / specimen match: 35/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Although `datasets/vibrio_biofilm_nematic_fountain/vibrio_cholerae_biofilm_specimen.jpg` is vendored on disk, the v1 script never loads, segments, or extracts rod cell count, major/minor axes, aspect ratio L/d, or 2D nematic orientation from the biological specimen image." ;
