        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "2019-yan-vibrio-biofilm-nematic-fountain.py L78–L91: Evaluates only 7-point cell-length table without loading or segmenting vibrio_cholerae_biofilm_specimen.jpg <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e93f00e/2019-yan-vibrio-biofilm-nematic-fountain.py#L78-L91>",
            "docs/media/vibrio_biofilm_nematic_fountain_comparison.png (generated output, not in repo): 4-panel v1 plot lacks Vibrio cholerae specimen segmentation, mutant controls, and radial expansion trajectory — docs/media/vibrio_biofilm_nematic_fountain_comparison.png: rendered output of 2019-yan-vibrio-biofilm-nematic-fountain.py at e93f00e, image/png, 153325 B, 1680×1330 px, artifact_sha256 0bb2af64dcd69827f6ffa1768dfb50fd515c873a4c6e74982ad6bc73ea81f9f5 (sha256 0bb2af64dcd69827f6ffa1768dfb50fd515c873a4c6e74982ad6bc73ea81f9f5), spec_fingerprint d831566c61695d418bb35d8095aa8c6100057ce72fecb5a3fc13843d4bcb5000" ;
